# 🌐 SocialPulse — Real-Time Social Media Platform

A full-stack, responsive social media web application built with React, Node.js, Express, MongoDB Atlas, and Socket.io. Features token authentication, role-based authorization (User/Admin), complete CRUD post operations, atomic likes, and live WebSocket feed updates without manual page reloads.

---

## 🚀 Key Features

- **Authentication & RBAC:** Secure registration and login using salted passwords (`bcryptjs`) and JWT access tokens. Distinct roles (`user` vs `admin`) enforce platform moderation rules.
- **Post Lifecycle (CRUD):** Users can create, view, edit, and delete posts (with optional image URL support).
- **Interactions:** Atomic like/unlike toggling and nested threaded comments on each post.
- **Real-Time Engine:** Built with `Socket.io`—new posts, updates, deletions, likes, and comments appear instantaneously across all connected clients.
- **Server Pagination:** Database queries use skip/limit pagination to keep data loading fast and responsive.
- **Modern UI:** Built with Tailwind CSS, Lucide icons, and a clean Slate & Indigo theme.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** React (Vite), React Router v6, Tailwind CSS, Axios, Lucide React, Socket.io-client
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js, Socket.io, Mongoose, JSON Web Tokens (JWT), Bcrypt.js
- **Database:** MongoDB Atlas (Cloud)
- **Deployment:** Render (Backend API + WebSockets), Vercel / Netlify (Frontend)

